            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Retail Customer Churn &amp; Sales Analytics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Project Overview:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> This dashboard correlates customer behavioral retention with financial performance metrics to identify revenue risks and channel effectiveness.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Churn Definition:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'><![CDATA[ Active (<45 days since last order), At-Risk (45−90 days), and Churned (>90 days).]]></run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Key Insight:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> Monitor high-value segments (e.g., Consumer and Premium tiers) against dominant sales channels (Mobile App and Website) to prioritize targeted retention campaigns.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
